UPDATE companies SET description='Rosti North Carolina operates as part of the Rosti Group, a global contract manufacturer specializing in precision plastic injection moulding. The group was founded in 1944 and maintains 13 manufacturing sites across Europe, Asia, and North America.

The company provides end-to-end production solutions, including plastic injection moulding, multi-material moulding, high-volume production, and cleanroom manufacturing in ISO-classified environments. Its capabilities extend to automation and assembly with robotic handling, automated inspection, and multi-step component integration, as well as toolmaking, engineering, and industrialisation services such as tool design, rapid sampling, pilot production, and global production transfer. The group emphasizes sustainable manufacturing, targeting 100 percent clean energy across all sites and a 50 percent energy efficiency improvement by 2040.

Rosti serves OEMs in medical and life sciences, automotive and e-mobility, consumer and home appliances, industrial and professional equipment, and filtration, optics, and high-performance components. Medical device, pharmaceutical, and diagnostic customers rely on its documented and validated quality workflows in cleanroom settings.

The company positions itself as a technical partner across the full product lifecycle, blending over 80 years of manufacturing heritage with a global footprint and a commitment to sustainability. Its five-stage manufacturing journey — consult and design support, prototype and validate, industrialise and optimise, scale and transfer, produce, assemble, and deliver — is designed to provide clarity, precision, and customer partnership.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485','ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection moulding", "Multi-material moulding", "High-volume production", "Complex geometry moulding", "Design for manufacture support", "Cleanroom manufacturing (ISO-classified)", "Medical device manufacturing", "Pharmaceutical and diagnostic manufacturing", "High-precision assembly", "Documented and validated quality workflows", "Automation and assembly", "Robotic handling and assembly", "Automated inspection", "Multi-step component integration", "High-reliability processes for regulated markets", "Toolmaking", "Tool design and validation", "Rapid sampling", "Pilot production", "Precision industrialisation workflows", "Global production transfer", "Sustainable manufacturing (clean energy transition, emissions reduction, circular design, resin optimisation, energy-efficient tooling)"], "industries": ["Medical & Life Sciences", "Automotive & E-Mobility", "Consumer & Home Appliances", "Industrial & Professional Equipment", "Filtration, Optics & High-Performance Components"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to multi-site full-scale manufacturing", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Global manufacturing network across Europe, Asia, and North America", "ISO-classified cleanroom capabilities for medical and life-science applications", "100 percent clean energy commitment across all sites", "Scalable production from prototypes to multi-site full-scale manufacturing", "80+ years of manufacturing heritage"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1944 -> db", "Headquarters in Cary, North Carolina -> db", "13 manufacturing sites globally -> /", "Certifications: ISO 9001, ISO 13485, ISO 14001 -> db", "Core capabilities: plastic injection moulding, multi-material moulding, high-volume production, cleanroom manufacturing, automation and assembly, toolmaking, engineering, industrialisation -> /capabilities", "Industries served: Medical & Life Sciences, Automotive & E-Mobility, Consumer & Home Appliances, Industrial & Professional Equipment, Filtration, Optics & High-Performance Components -> /capabilities", "Sustainability commitments: 100% clean energy, 50% energy efficiency improvement by 2040 -> /", "Five-stage manufacturing journey -> /capabilities", "Language options: English, Deutsch, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, American English, Rom\u00e2n\u0103 -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Rosti is a global partner in advanced plastic manufacturing and end-to-end production solutions.", "founded_year": "1944", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": ["English", "Deutsch", "T\u00fcrk\u00e7e", "American English", "Rom\u00e2n\u0103"], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rosti-north-carolina' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
