UPDATE companies SET description='Roy''s Wood Products was founded in 1962 in Lugoff, South Carolina, when Roy Brazell Sr. began crafting cabinet doors in a garage shop. The business remained family-owned through three generations: Roy Jr. purchased the operation in 1985 and expanded it to 15,000 square feet, and in 2008 his sons Jody and Russell Brazell took ownership. The company was renamed Roy''s Wood Products, Inc. in 2000 to reflect its broadening product lines.

Today the company operates over 61,000 square feet of factory space that includes a rough mill and a dedicated cabinet door manufacturing facility. It produces a full line of stock and custom wood products: custom cabinet doors and drawer fronts, dovetail drawer boxes, face frame material, hardwood plywood, mouldings, dimensional lumber, shutters, and a range of hardware and accessories.

Roy''s Wood Products emphasizes an old-fashioned focus on excellence at a reasonable price, backed by experienced craftsmen and modern tooling. The Brazell family''s hands-on leadership and six-decade track record are cited as the foundation for consistent quality and service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet doors", "Drawer fronts", "Dovetail drawer boxes", "Face frame material", "Hardwood plywood", "Mouldings", "Dimensional lumber", "Shutters", "Hardware and accessories", "Rough milling", "Cabinet door manufacturing"], "industries": ["Custom woodworking", "Cabinet making"], "materials": ["Hardwood", "Plywood", "Dimensional lumber", "Mouldings"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family owned and operated for over 60 years", "Over 61,000 sq ft factory with rough mill and cabinet door manufacturing facility", "Three generations of Brazell family leadership", "Full line of stock and custom wood products", "Quality products at a reasonable price"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1962 by Roy Brazell Sr. in Lugoff, SC -> /about", "Family owned and operated for over 60 years -> /", "Facility over 61,000 sq ft with rough mill and cabinet door manufacturing facility -> /about", "Products include custom cabinet doors, drawer fronts, dovetail drawer boxes, face frame material, hardwood plywood, mouldings, dimensional lumber, shutters, hardware and accessories -> /", "Three generations of Brazell family leadership -> /about", "Quality products at a reasonable price -> /", "Experienced craftsmen and state of the art tools -> /", "Showroom at 659A Lachicotte Rd, Lugoff, SC 29078 -> /", "Name changed to Roy''s Wood Products, Inc. in 2000 -> /about", "Sons Jody and Russell purchased business in 2008 -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Now with over 61,000 sq ft. of factory space that includes a rough mill and a cabinet door manufacturing facili