UPDATE companies SET description='Ruben Custom Sawmill and Woodworks, LLC is based in White Bear Township, Minnesota. What began as a weekend passion project has grown into a full-time, family-run operation serving clients throughout the Twin Cities metro area.

The business focuses on three core areas: custom furniture such as live-edge tables, bar tops, and mantles; premium walnut countertops built in a butcher-block style; and portable milling services that bring a Wood-Mizer sawmill directly to a client''s property to process logs into kiln-dried slabs and native hardwood lumber. The shop also maintains an inventory of kiln-dried slabs available by appointment.

Customers range from homeowners seeking one-of-a-kind dining tables or mantels to DIY woodworkers purchasing slabs for their own projects, as well as landowners who want logs milled on-site for future interior work. Testimonials on the company''s site highlight residential clients in the Twin Cities area who have commissioned custom furniture, countertops, and on-site milling of cherry and burr oak logs.

Ruben states that the company was started to give fallen trees a second life and to preserve the stories embedded in each slab, turning what would be waste into lasting functional art. The founder emphasizes care, craftsmanship, and character in every job, whether milling on a client''s land or building a custom piece in the shop.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Live-edge table fabrication", "Bar top and mantle fabrication", "Custom walnut countertop fabrication", "Portable sawmilling", "Kiln drying", "Lumber sales"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Walnut", "Cherry", "Burr oak", "Native hardwoods", "Salvaged wood"], "equipment": ["Wood-Mizer Portable Sawmill"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Portable milling service that brings the sawmill to the customer''s property", "Kiln-dried slabs and native hardwoods sold by appointment", "Family-owned and operated full-time since 2018", "Custom furniture crafted from the client''s own salvaged logs"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2018 by Matt Ruben -> db", "Headquarters in White Bear Township, Minnesota -> db", "Family-run business -> /", "Services: custom furniture, countertops, portable milling, kiln-dried lumber -> /", "Wood-Mizer Portable Sawmill used -> /", "Materials: walnut, cherry, burr oak, native hardwoods -> /", "Over 1,000 trees salvaged, 1,000+ clients -> /", "Portable milling on client''s land -> /", "Kiln-dried slabs available by appointment -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We craft timeless furniture, countertops, and kiln-dried lumber from locally salvaged wood.", "founded_year": "2018", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ruben-custom-sawmill-and-woodworks-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Rustic Log Furniture of Utah, Inc. operates from Orem, Utah. The company traces its roots to the summer of 1997 when Randy Jackson began producing log porch swings with the goal of shipping them nationwide. In early 1998 his brother Rodney joined the venture, and the product line quickly expanded beyond swings to include beds, dressers, dining tables, chairs, and a growing catalog of cabin-style furnishings. The business remains family-owned, now run by the Jackson family.

In addition to solid-wood pieces, the company produces complementary lines such as bedding, metal works, wood carvings and burnings, photography, and metal and antler chandeliers. Production includes custom orders for both residential and commercial clients.

Rustic Log Furniture serves customers across all 50 states, parts of Canada, and Europe. Its pieces have furnished professional establishments including the Cedar Hills Community Center in Utah and Marriott vacation properties in Park City and South Lake Tahoe. The entertainment industry has also sourced products for Warner Bros.’ film Unaccompanied Minors, Paramount’s series Yellowstone, and stage productions at the Hale Center Theater in Orem.

