UPDATE companies SET description='Rustic Montana Furniture operates from Philipsburg, Montana, where it has been producing handcrafted western furniture for over two decades. While the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed, the firm emphasizes its long-standing presence in the state and its commitment to local manufacturing.

The company designs and builds a range of solid-wood pieces including beds, end tables, console tables, dressers, chests, vanities, dining tables, benches, and outdoor swings. Every bed uses true mortise-and-tenon joinery, and dining tables are made from one-of-a-kind reclaimed lumber. Production is described as entirely handcrafted, with custom design services offered alongside standard product lines. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

The firm markets directly to homeowners seeking authentic western aesthetics, positioning its work as heirloom-quality furniture for residential spaces. The website does not list specific commercial clients, interior-design accounts, or wholesale channels, so the primary customer base appears to be individual consumers.

Rustic Montana Furniture highlights its "Made in Montana" certification and its use of traditional mortise-and-tenon construction as key differentiators. The emphasis on reclaimed barnwood and log materials, along with the promise that each dining table is unique, frames the brand around authenticity and durability rather than mass production.', certifications=ARRAY['Made in Montana certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mortise and tenon joinery", "Custom furniture design", "Handcrafted assembly", "Reclaimed wood fabrication", "Log furniture fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Custom furniture", "Western furniture"], "materials": ["Reclaimed barnwood", "Log", "Reclaimed lumber"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["\"Made in Montana\" certified", "True mortise-and-tenon construction on all beds", "One-of-a-kind dining tables from reclaimed lumber", "Handcrafted from barnwood or log", "Custom furniture design and build"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Philipsburg, Montana -> db", "Walter Stanghill listed as contact -> /about", "Over 20 years in business -> /about", "Mortise and tenon construction on all beds -> /", "Made in Montana certified -> /", "Products: beds, tables, consoles, dressers, chests, vanities, benches, swings -> /", "Materials: reclaimed barnwood, log, reclaimed lumber -> /", "Custom furniture design and build -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We design and build authentic mortise & tenon furniture, all in Montana.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rustic-montana-furniture' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
