UPDATE companies SET description='S. C. Hopkins Woodworking operates from Honey Brook, Pennsylvania, where it produces custom furniture and artisan home goods.

The shop builds made-to-order furniture and one-of-a-kind home accents, offering a personalized commission service that lets clients collaborate directly on custom woodworking projects. Its output ranges from larger household pieces to smaller decorative items, all crafted in-house using woodworking methods.

Its website describes the work as "expertly crafted pieces for the practical household" and "beautifully made smaller items for every home," indicating a focus on the consumer market rather than industrial or commercial sectors.

