UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Charlotte, North Carolina, SPI Solar Panel Installation NC is a locally owned and operated solar and roofing contractor that has served homeowners across the state for more than ten years. The company was founded by a team of certified installers who recognized that many North Carolina residents were being approached by out-of-state firms that relied on subcontractors and offered little ongoing support.

The firm provides a full suite of residential energy services, including custom rooftop solar design and installation, solar panel repair, complete roof installation, repair and inspection, home battery storage, electric vehicle charger installation, solar-powered heat pumps, home insulation and sealing, and solar shading systems.

The company tailors each project to the home’s specific energy usage, roof condition, and local utility requirements, and also assists with permitting and utility interconnection paperwork.

The founders started the business to address what they saw as a gap in the market: out-of-state solar and roofing companies making large promises, sending subcontractors, and disappearing after installation. SPI differentiates itself by using only certified local installers, offering transparent pricing, a 25-year performance guarantee, free home assessments, and dedicated aftercare support for the life of the system.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential rooftop solar panel installation", "Solar panel repair", "Roof installation", "Roof repair and replacement", "Roof inspection", "Home energy system monitoring and optimization", "Solar heat pump installation", "Home battery storage installation", "Electric vehicle (EV) charger installation", "Home insulation and sealing", "Solar shade installation"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Roofing", "Home energy storage", "EV charging infrastructure", "Home insulation", "Solar shading"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Physical installation completed in one to two days; full process from assessment to live system typically four to eight weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No subcontractors \u2013 all work done by own certified local crews", "25-year performance guarantee on installations", "Free home solar assessment and custom system design", "Transparent pricing with financing options available", "Dedicated aftercare and monitoring for the life of the system"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Charlotte, North Carolina -> db", "Locally owned and operated -> /about-us", "10+ years of local experience -> /", "Services: residential solar installation, solar repair, roof installation, roof repair/replacement, roof inspection, home energy systems, solar heat pumps, home battery, EV charger, insulation, solar shading -> /services", "No subcontractors, certified local installers -> /about-us, /", "25-year performance guarantee -> /, /about-us", "Free home s