UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2005 in North Las Vegas, Nevada, SRS Fabrication Inc. began as a modest 5,000-square-foot shop and has grown into a multi-building operation spanning over 56,000 square feet across three facilities on North Coleman Street and West Brooks Avenue.

The shop combines precision welding and fabrication, carpentry, and scenic/artistic services under one roof. The facility houses equipment such as a KUKA robotic arm, a Massivit 1800 3D printer, a Flow Mach 500 waterjet, RMT press brakes and band saws, Anderson STRATOS CNC routers, a Frog Mill 4-axis foam router, and a Belovac thermoformer. Staff includes certified welders, carpenters, scenic sculptors, painters, draftsmen, and project managers.

