_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "A leading manufacturer of high-quality HDPE bottles for a wide range of industries and applications", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='sage-plastics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sailor Plastics operates its manufacturing facility in Adrian, Minnesota, producing plastic bottles and containers made in the USA. The company does not disclose a founding year, ownership structure, or founder names in its public materials.

The company manufactures PET and LDPE containers in a range of styles — honey bear, square, round, oval, and specialty shapes — along with caps and closures. It runs custom-made equipment and automation systems that are regularly updated, and it maintains an expanded tool inventory to shorten wait times. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

Sailor Plastics serves food and beverage packagers, supplying bottles for honey, juices, sauces, liquor and spirits, and spices. Its customers include brands seeking both stock and custom packaging solutions.

